---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About SidJam Studio, an independent creative studio. Stories are our first project, and more ventures are on the way.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <span class="kicker">About the studio</span>
    <h1>A home for ideas worth making.</h1>
  </section>

  <div class="about prose">
    <p>
      SidJam Studio is a small, independent creative studio. We start with an idea we can't
      stop thinking about, turn it into something real, and share it with people who'll
      enjoy it.
    </p>
    <p>
      We don't plan to make only one kind of thing. Every new idea gets its own project
      under the SidJam name.
    </p>

    <h2>What we're making</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Stories — live now.</strong> Original stories for readers aged 5 to 13. They're
        funny and a little chaotic, and each one carries a real idea about courage, honesty,
        listening, money, or how computers think. <a href="/stories/">Read them here.</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>More on the way.</strong> New ventures will launch over time. Each one
        will get its own page on this site.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Make it with care.</strong> Whatever we make, we finish it properly.</li>
      <li><strong>Keep it fun.</strong> If it isn't fun to make or fun to use, we rethink it.</li>
      <li><strong>Leave people better off.</strong> Everything we make should give people something worth keeping.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Say hello</h2>
    <p>
      For questions, collaborations, school readings, or ideas you think we should try,
      write to <a href="mailto:hello@sidjamstudio.com">hello@sidjamstudio.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
